"entity": {
"name": "Zalando SE",
"description": "Zalando SE engages in the business of developing, sourcing, marketing, retailing, and commission selling clothing and shoes, as well as related consumer and partner facing services. It operates through Business-to-Business and Business-to-Consumer segments. The Business-to-Business segment focuses on providing products and services to partners channels. The Business-to-Consumer segment provides supporting services to partner and retail media business as well as the ABOUT YOU Commerce business. The company was founded by Robert Gentz and David Schneider on February 26, 2008 and is headquartered in Berlin, Germany.",
